    "title": "AKU students win PTV quiz competition",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "The Medical Students of Aga Khan University participated in and won the 1st round of the All Pakistan Inter-University Quaid-e-Azam Quiz Competition being organized by Pakistan Television to celebrate \"The Year of Quaid-e-Azam\".",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "85e0531643715f32",
        "component": "news_media",
